              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mwimwi mwaasi lagizo ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, mchirema kuphiya kpwenye tsi hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanungʼunika ndani ya mahema genu mchiamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu akahuzira ndiyo mana wahutuluza tsi ya Misiri ili ahutiye mikononi mwa Aamori kusudi ahumarigize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hunaambuka kuphiyaphi phahi? Naswi hukavundzwa moyo ni ndugu zehu ariphohuambira kukala atu a hiko ni akulu na are kuriko swiswi. Na kukala midzi yao ni mikulu na yenye kuta zinazofika mainguni. Piya aona gara madzitu makulu, ga chivyazi cha Anaki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
