          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mino nchikuambirani, “Msiaogophe atu hinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ambaye anakutanguliyani, iye mwenye andapigana kpwa ajili yenu dza vira arivyohenda mbere zenu hiko Misiri na ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 13:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiko jangbwani. Mwimwi mwaona vira Mlungu arivyokutsukulani kpwenye charo hicho chosi dza vira baba anavyotsukula mwanawe, hadi mchifika hipha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 3:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela dzagbwe nágomba higo gosi, mwino tamuyamuamini Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ambaye wakutanguliyani katika njira na kukuendzerani mwatu mwa kuchita kambi zenu. Usiku wakutanguliyani kpwa moho na mutsi kpwa ingu, ili kukuonyesani njira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
